Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.29,0:00:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记起来了\N{\rEng}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看见她起来了  所以...\N{\rEng}Saw she was up, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.87,0:01:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情是怎么发生的\N{\rEng}How'd it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我\N{\rEng}Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.67,0:02:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈死了\N{\rEng}My mother's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她被咬了\N{\rEng}She was bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得眼睁睁看着她死去\N{\rEng}I had to watch her die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在不久之前\N{\rEng}Not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她相信人们  他们的灵魂\N{\rEng}And she believed people, their -- their souls...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被困在怪物之身里\N{\rEng}were trapped in the bodies of the monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀掉死者\N{\rEng}that killing the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让生者进入来世\N{\rEng}lets the living move on into an afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔当时正带我回你们社区\N{\rEng}Carl was taking me back to your community,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟他说了我妈妈的想法\N{\rEng}and I told him what my mother believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看到了几个行尸\N{\rEng}And we saw a few of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想向她致敬\N{\rEng}He wanted to honor her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他是想向我证明我能信任他\N{\rEng}I think he was trying to show me that I could trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情就这样发生了\N{\rEng}That's how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他向一个未曾谋面的女人\N{\rEng}He died paying respects
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,致敬时死掉了\N{\rEng}to a woman he never knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那很危险\N{\rEng}But it was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那很危险  我没想到\N{\rEng}It was dangerous, ‭and I didn't think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该想到的\N{\rEng}I should've.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们失去的人们仅剩的\N{\rEng}But all that's left of the people we lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,属于他们的东西\N{\rEng}what was theirs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.11,0:04:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他们的思想\N{\rEng}are their ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们今天要打败他们\N{\rEng}We're gonna beat 'em today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后你会回神之国吗\N{\rEng}And when we do, will you come back to the Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会再逃跑了\N{\rEng}I won't run away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\rEng}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗  老大\N{\rEng}How you doin', boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果今早是我们度过的最后一个早晨\N{\rEng}If this morning is to be our last,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:08.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会是个美好的早晨\N{\rEng}it will be a fine morning, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后个屁\N{\rEng}This isn't the last of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们的一些战友来说可能是\N{\rEng}It could be for some of our ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我接受这点\N{\rEng}I accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我屁都不接受\N{\rEng}I'm not accepting shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.89,0:05:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是简单的接受或者悲观\N{\rEng}It's not simple acceptance or pessimism, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那样的\N{\rEng}Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了证明我们失去的一切是值得的\N{\rEng}But to justify everything we've lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须冒着失去一切的风险去战斗\N{\rEng}we must risk losing everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们屁都不会失去\N{\rEng}We're not losing shit --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰瑞\N{\rEng}Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们沿着这条路  走森林里\N{\rEng}We'll stick to this road, keep to the trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会更快赶到\N{\rEng}we'll get there quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那样的话我们还可以留意这条路\N{\rEng}Plus, we can keep an eye on the road that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  如果他们有什么计划  我们会看到的\N{\rEng}Yeah, if they're planning anything, we'll see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得你可以信任格雷戈里吗\N{\rEng}You think you can trust Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟我们说了什么\N{\rEng}What he told us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他锁在了房子里\N{\rEng}I locked him up inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道我不会让他在这里自由走动\N{\rEng}He knew I wouldn't ‭let him walk around free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道回来后要被关起来\N{\rEng}He knew he was coming back to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只相信他自己\N{\rEng}He doesn't believe ‭in anything except himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他肯定得非常相信救世军\N{\rEng}and he'd have to believe in the Saviors a whole lot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会把我们送进陷阱\N{\rEng}to send us into a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并觉得这对他有好处\N{\rEng}and think it would work out for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非德怀特没跟他说真相\N{\rEng}Unless Dwight didn't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那混蛋可能在设计我们\N{\rEng}That asshole could be setting us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\rEng}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根  怎么了\N{\rEng}Morgan, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不见了\N{\rEng}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有所图谋\N{\rEng}They're doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们...\N{\rEng}They were, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不见了  他\N{\rEng}They were gone -- him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要进来了\N{\rEng}They were coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问了玛姬我们能否清理墙边的行尸\N{\rEng}I asked Maggie if we could clear the walkers from the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们引开了它们\N{\rEng}We...drew them away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我们出发时就不用担心它们了\N{\rEng}so we wouldn't have to worry about 'em when we rolled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:25.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.21,0:07:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续准备吧  各位\N{\rEng}Let's keep gettin' ready, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一支小队20分钟后出发\N{\rEng}First team's going in 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚说"我们出发时"\N{\rEng}You said when we roll out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和你的人不去\N{\rEng}You and your people aren't coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以留在这里\N{\rEng}You can be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不是我们的一员\N{\rEng}But you're not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说清楚了就好\N{\rEng}As long as we got that straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你不该和我们一起去\N{\rEng}Maybe you shouldn't come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.92,0:07:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\rEng}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:07:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得已经够多了\N{\rEng}You've done plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\rEng}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.11,0:08:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-摩根  -瑞克\N{\rEng}- Morgan -- - ‭Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须去  我必须去...\N{\rEng}I have to. I have t-to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关键不在我\N{\rEng}It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而在于其他人  我得保护他们\N{\rEng}It's everybody else, and I'm gonna keep 'em alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得保护亨利不受...\N{\rEng}I'm gonna keep Henry from...f--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们...\N{\rEng}We...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们越变越糟了  我和你\N{\rEng}We are worse than we were... me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\rEng}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.77,0:08:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前在酒吧里对那些人讲的那番话\N{\rEng}Giving your word to those men back at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是不可避免的  没错  但是...\N{\rEng}I mean, it's what it took, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那事没那么简单\N{\rEng}But that was something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不该做那种事\N{\rEng}That was something wrong for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:55.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们越界是因为\N{\rEng}And we crossed into it because -- because...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:09:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都失去了一切  一切美好的事物\N{\rEng}we've both lost everything, everything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那...\N{\rEng}What --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们现在竭尽所有保护大家\N{\rEng}What does it matter if we spend whatever's left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么意义呢\N{\rEng}on keeping people alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们并没有失去一切\N{\rEng}Because we haven't lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-没有完全失去  -已经失去了\N{\rEng}- Not yet. ‭- We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我们无法回头\N{\rEng}And we can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以让我们快点了结吧\N{\rEng}So let's just finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.87,0:12:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真惨啊  是不是  小德\N{\rEng}Sucks, don't it, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前就算你脸上\N{\rEng}I mean, even with that disgusting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那块恶心的疤痕\N{\rEng}knotted cheese on the side of your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家还是尊重你的\N{\rEng}you once had these people's respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在呢\N{\rEng}But now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你一无所有\N{\rEng}Well, now you don't have a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他上车\N{\rEng}Load him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是我的子弹制造者嘛\N{\rEng}There's my bullet maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本人随队行动\N{\rEng}Attaché in tow
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,订单如承诺般迅速完成\N{\rEng}and order fulfilled PDQ, as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一发子弹都由在下亲自进行质量把关\N{\rEng}Every munition personally quality-controlled by yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不睡觉  拼命干\N{\rEng}Sleep be damned and efforts be tripled,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务完成\N{\rEng}the deed is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您试用\N{\rEng}Take yourself a tester.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:31.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞吉娜和你说过计划了  是吧\N{\rEng}Regina laid out the plan for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才要求随队行动\N{\rEng}That's why I requested the ride-along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鉴于地形和时机\N{\rEng}Depending on the terrain and timing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及紧张局势\N{\rEng}the pump and priming,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为应尝试一击制敌\N{\rEng}I believe we should attempt a one-fell-swooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列队射击降低混乱率\N{\rEng}A firing line that would minimize chaos opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分钟内就能结束战斗\N{\rEng}and alpha-to-omega this thing in less than 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定你想看到这一幕吗\N{\rEng}Are you sure that's something you want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准确地说是"需要"看到\N{\rEng}More of a "need to" Thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你\N{\rEng}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把东西都装好  出发\N{\rEng}Let's load up, roll out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兰斯  杜克  去伯耶兰路\N{\rEng}Lance, Duke -- Boylan Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果出事了  地图上有写我会去哪\N{\rEng}Map will show you where I'll be if there's trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.65,0:14:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了  我们牢牢记在脑海里了  老大\N{\rEng}No, we got this one locked down, Jefe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\rEng}Damn straight you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\rEng}Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.67,0:14:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不如也一起来吧  小加\N{\rEng}Why don't you tag along, Gabey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这趟旅程不错的\N{\rEng}It's a nice drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想忏悔一些事\N{\rEng}I got some shit that I want to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保佑我吧  神父  我有罪\N{\rEng}Bless me, father, for I have sin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\rEng}probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时就要开始了\N{\rEng}Any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我派到路上去设置行尸路障的那些人\N{\rEng}Now, those men I sent out down there on their road setting up their road block with the dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.99,0:15:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对自己马上要丧命这点一无所知\N{\rEng}not knowing they're joining their cold asses any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.18,0:15:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为瑞克和他那群混蛋\N{\rEng}Cos Rick and his band of pricks
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就要袭击他们了\N{\rEng}will gonna hit them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不享受让自己人去送死\N{\rEng}You know, I don't enjoy sacrificing my own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你清楚这点吧\N{\rEng}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人支持过西蒙\N{\rEng}I mean, those guys back there, they came up with Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有人得为团队做牺牲\N{\rEng}Some of us had to take one for the team,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就让他们牺牲吧\N{\rEng}it may as well be them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.77,0:15:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是不明白\N{\rEng}I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小瑞克得到了一些消息\N{\rEng}Ricky was slipped some intel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为他能抢在我之前行动\N{\rEng}make him think he can get the jump on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上  那消息的来源不太靠谱\N{\rEng}The thing is, it came from a less-than-reliable source,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以如果我是他  我会先探探路\N{\rEng}so if I were him, I'd be scouting ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉那个路障小队\N{\rEng}Taking out that little road-block crew
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会让瑞克以为得到了我位置的确切消息\N{\rEng}is gonna make Rick think he's got the real story, where I'll really be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会来找我\N{\rEng}They'll come to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那才是陷阱\N{\rEng}But, see, that is the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是伏击他们的办法\N{\rEng}And that is how we will get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会找到一张地图\N{\rEng}they are gonna find the map
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写着我要去的时间和地点\N{\rEng}with the time and place I will be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会坚信不疑\N{\rEng}and they gonna believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们不会留活口\N{\rEng}because they will have killed all of those poor bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我投降\N{\rEng}I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我投降  我认输\N{\rEng}I give up! I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我投降\N{\rEng}I'm done! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们  太变态了\N{\rEng}Dude! That was messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:33.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说  天啊\N{\rEng}I mean, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死不了  对吧\N{\rEng}You don't die, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\rEng}Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该找机会试试\N{\rEng}You oughta try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\rEng}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.15,0:16:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会以为看过那么多人死\N{\rEng}You don't think you can kill your way out of this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能靠杀人摆脱吧  对吧\N{\rEng}seeing everybody else go, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你\N{\rEng}'Cause let me tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摆脱不了的\N{\rEng}not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\rEng}Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\rEng}Are you with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  在我们的采石场找到了线索\N{\rEng}Good people, found something on our quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么线索\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个单子和另一张地图\N{\rEng}A list and another map.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎和我们的不一样\N{\rEng}And what appear to be other facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.23,0:17:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军在老磨坊路列队呢\N{\rEng}They're lining up Saviors on the Old Mill Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根一定会去那\N{\rEng}That's where Negan will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得在他们知道这里的事之前找到尼根\N{\rEng}We have to get to Negan before they figure out what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\rEng}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在\N{\rEng}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\rEng}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是陷阱\N{\rEng}It was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们要改变计划\N{\rEng}So we're changing the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这吗\N{\rEng}So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要忏悔的就是\N{\rEng}Your confession is that you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要杀光他们所有人吗\N{\rEng}gonna kill every last one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前忏悔的时候  看起来\N{\rEng}When you spoke before, you seemed almost
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像真心不希望这种事发生\N{\rEng}as if you didn't want it to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这与希望无关  小加\N{\rEng}It ain't about want, Gabey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来都是无关的\N{\rEng}It never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发\N{\rEng}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别去  他什么都看不清\N{\rEng}Hang back! He can't see crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金  我必须警告他们\N{\rEng}Eugene, I have to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你不能这么做  -闭上你的臭嘴\N{\rEng}- You can't do this. - Shut up. Shut your damn mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:18:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我会用自制弹药\N{\rEng}or so help me, I will use a homemade munition
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.28,0:19:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此时此地打爆你的颅骨\N{\rEng}to crack your cranium right here, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\rEng}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\rEng}Do you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\rEng}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正需要的时候  你的信仰又在哪\N{\rEng}Where does your faith go when you truly need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:21.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我看来  现在才是最该坚持信仰的时候\N{\rEng}Seems to me it's the only time worth holding on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  尤金\N{\rEng}Sorry, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小加得归我处置\N{\rEng}I'm gonna have to call dibs on Gabey boy myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过你不想无谓牺牲\N{\rEng}You said you didn't want to die a fruitless death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人不能实现所有愿望\N{\rEng}Well, you can't always get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他上车\N{\rEng}Load him into the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想保护这些人\N{\rEng}You want to keep these people safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了这个目的你觉得自己必须杀人\N{\rEng}and you think you need to kill other people to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对你来说并不安全\N{\rEng}That's not exactly safe for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终也会给你要保护的人带来危险\N{\rEng}which ultimately may not be safe for the people you're trying to keep safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个难题\N{\rEng}It's a conundrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又或者不是\N{\rEng}Or it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不杀人也可以阻止他们\N{\rEng}But you can stop people without killing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说  以前你差点阻止过我\N{\rEng}I mean, you almost stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.82,0:20:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个简单的提议\N{\rEng}I have a simple proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以试试\N{\rEng}Something to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一端对付死人  这一端对付活人\N{\rEng}This end for the dead, and this end for the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况会变好的\N{\rEng}And things will get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶稣\N{\rEng}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开始喜欢这家伙了\N{\rEng}I'm starting to like that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.87,0:21:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Holy damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过这么大的尸群吗\N{\rEng}You ever seen one that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.69,0:21:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都在变\N{\rEng}Things are changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\rEng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.71,0:21:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-还有多远  -越来越近了\N{\rEng}- How much further? - We grow closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边  过桥\N{\rEng}Yonder, over the ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军\N{\rEng}Saviors!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  瑞克  瞧瞧\N{\rEng}Well, damn, Rick, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又中计了  又大大地中计了\N{\rEng}Pegged again. Pegged so very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用更大的埋伏\N{\rEng}I ambushed your ambush
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埋伏了你的埋伏\N{\rEng}with an even bigger ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不正大光明地出来  面对我们\N{\rEng}How about you step out and face us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无处不在  瑞克\N{\rEng}Oh, I am everywhere, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都有扩音器\N{\rEng}Some more bullhorns,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都有对讲机\N{\rEng}more walkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.31,0:22:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选个逃跑的方向吧\N{\rEng}Pick a direction to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.28,0:22:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你能跑多远\N{\rEng}See how you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们都找点乐子\N{\rEng}Make it fun for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜我还做了什么\N{\rEng}Guess what else I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.90,0:22:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还带了几个你的老朋友来\N{\rEng}I brought you some of your old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.22,0:22:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得你的老朋友尤金吗\N{\rEng}You remember your old buddy Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他造就了今天的一切\N{\rEng}Well, he is the person that made today possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位小德怀特也一样\N{\rEng}Same goes for Dwighty boy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想知道的话  他不是故意出卖你的\N{\rEng}In case you were wondering, he didn't ream you on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.86,0:23:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他只是...一个没种的废物\N{\rEng}No, he is just a -- a gutless nothin' that sucks at life,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.99,0:23:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他要站在这里  眼睁睁看着你们死\N{\rEng}and now he gets to stand up here and watch you all die,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.03,0:23:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并背负这一切\N{\rEng}and he's gonna live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.75,0:23:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加百利\N{\rEng}Gabriel, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也得死\N{\rEng}...he's got to go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.16,0:23:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我们要清理门户  瑞克\N{\rEng}We are cleaning house today, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后...就轮到你了\N{\rEng}And then...there's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.88,0:23:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本没必要战斗\N{\rEng}It never had to be a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.45,0:23:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只用接受事实\N{\rEng}You just had to accept how things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.90,0:23:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么\N{\rEng}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.64,0:23:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\rEng}here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.09,0:23:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你  瑞克\N{\rEng}Congratulations, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.49,0:24:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三\N{\rEng}3!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.28,0:24:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\rEng}2!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.36,0:24:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\rEng}1!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.01,0:24:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上\N{\rEng}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.32,0:24:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\rEng}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.39,0:25:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要跑了\N{\rEng}He's running!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷戈里已经出来了吗\N{\rEng}Is Gregory already out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.98,0:25:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把他留在屋里了\N{\rEng}We left him inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.23,0:25:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他交给他们吧\N{\rEng}Let them have him. Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.27,0:25:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续走  去集合点\N{\rEng}Keep going. To the rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.57,0:25:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人应该已经到了\N{\rEng}The others should already be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.96,0:25:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-等等  -怎么了\N{\rEng}- Hold up! - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.95,0:25:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去试试拖住他们\N{\rEng}I'm gonna try and slow them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.10,0:25:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧  去吧\N{\rEng}Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:45.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就你一个人吗\N{\rEng}What, just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.77,0:25:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们能听到她的声音\N{\rEng}Look, they can hear her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.45,0:25:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-在新泽西都能听到  -这我说不准\N{\rEng}- They can hear her in New Jersey. - I don't know about Jersey,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.86,0:25:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不会让你一个人去\N{\rEng}but I'm not letting you do this by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.44,0:25:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我可能给你枪吗\N{\rEng}You think I'm gonna give you a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给不给我都会留下来\N{\rEng}I'm gonna stay one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.11,0:25:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有想跟我一起的吗\N{\rEng}Any of you gents with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.51,0:26:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我跟她一起\N{\rEng}'Cause I'm with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.71,0:26:03.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算她不把我们当自己人\N{\rEng}Even if she's not with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.57,0:26:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他干的  抓住他\N{\rEng}He did this! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.59,0:26:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\rEng}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.83,0:26:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\rEng}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.88,0:26:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用这么做\N{\rEng}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.01,0:26:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这里清理了吧\N{\rEng}Let's clean this up now, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.03,0:26:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再等一下\N{\rEng}Give it another second.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.70,0:27:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\rEng}Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.93,0:27:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.93,0:27:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们输了\N{\rEng}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\rEng}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.33,0:28:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你一件事\N{\rEng}Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.50,0:28:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点兵点将\N{\rEng}eenie meenie miney moe,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.00,0:28:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是胡扯\N{\rEng}that was bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.14,0:28:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了选择\N{\rEng}I made a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.87,0:28:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是不想在一个孩子面前杀死他的父亲\N{\rEng}I just didn't want to kill a kid's dad in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在看来  杀你才是我最好的选择\N{\rEng}Turns out that would've been the best thing I could've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果当初我杀了你  那孩子还能活着\N{\rEng}Had I done it, ‭that kid might still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.69,0:29:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被打败了\N{\rEng}You're beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.89,0:29:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的人都倒下了\N{\rEng}Your people are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.25,0:29:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会脱身的\N{\rEng}I'll get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.22,0:29:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一向如此\N{\rEng}I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.78,0:29:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩你和我了  瑞克\N{\rEng}It's just you and me, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.13,0:29:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你  你内心支离破碎\N{\rEng}And you -- you are torn open.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我更高大  更坏\N{\rEng}I am bigger, I am badder,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有根球棒\N{\rEng}and I got a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:43.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以有未来\N{\rEng}We can have a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.56,0:29:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我有\N{\rEng}I know I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.32,0:29:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我十秒钟\N{\rEng}Just give me -- give me 10 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.15,0:29:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能跟你解释\N{\rEng}so I can -- I can tell you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.75,0:29:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.68,0:29:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了卡尔  给我十秒钟\N{\rEng}Just give me 10 seconds for Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.24,0:30:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十\N{\rEng}10...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.03,0:30:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九\N{\rEng}9...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.13,0:30:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔说没必要...\N{\rEng}Carl said it doesn't have to be --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.62,0:30:11.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没必要非得战斗\N{\rEng}it doesn't have to be a fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.47,0:30:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他错了  八\N{\rEng}He was wrong. 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  他说得对\N{\rEng}No, no. He was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你做了什么\N{\rEng}Look what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.31,0:30:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔什么都不知道\N{\rEng}Carl didn't know a damn thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.67,0:31:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救他\N{\rEng}Save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.54,0:32:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  玛姬  玛姬\N{\rEng}No! ‭Maggie! Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.17,0:32:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不行\N{\rEng}No, he can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.64,0:32:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.37,0:32:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他杀了格伦\N{\rEng}No, he killed Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.89,0:32:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须救他\N{\rEng}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.10,0:32:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须了结这一切\N{\rEng}We have to end it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.91,0:32:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\rEng}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.14,0:32:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须纠正错误\N{\rEng}We have to make it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.26,0:32:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纠正不了的  但这能结束一切\N{\rEng}We can't make it right, but this makes it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.11,0:32:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-结束了  -不\N{\rEng}- It's over. - ‭No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.21,0:32:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没结束\N{\rEng}It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.44,0:32:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了才算结束\N{\rEng}It's not over until he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.30,0:32:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了才算结束\N{\rEng}It's not over till he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.64,0:32:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.98,0:32:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.31,0:32:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.68,0:32:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.57,0:32:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.21,0:32:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所发生过的  我们所做过的\N{\rEng}What happened, what we did...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.25,0:32:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们所失去的\N{\rEng}what we lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.59,0:32:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来一定不只如此\N{\rEng}there's gotta be something after.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.21,0:32:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举起手的都把手放下\N{\rEng}The ones who have 'em up, put your hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.24,0:33:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在都要回家了\N{\rEng}We're all gonna go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.93,0:33:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根还活着\N{\rEng}Negan's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.03,0:33:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他那套结束了\N{\rEng}But his way of doing things is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.94,0:33:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能接受这一点的人\N{\rEng}And anyone who can't live with that
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.70,0:33:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会付出代价  我保证\N{\rEng}will pay the price, I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天在场的\N{\rEng}And any person here
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.44,0:33:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何崇尚和平公正的人\N{\rEng}who would live in peace and fairness...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.45,0:33:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿意求同存异的人\N{\rEng}who would find common ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.95,0:33:37.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界属于你们\N{\rEng}this world is yours, by right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.90,0:33:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是活人\N{\rEng}We are life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.43,0:33:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些是死人\N{\rEng}That's death!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.95,0:33:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们要来杀我们\N{\rEng}And it's coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.55,0:33:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非我们团结一致\N{\rEng}Unless we stand together!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.49,0:33:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以回家吧\N{\rEng}So go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.21,0:33:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后开始工作\N{\rEng}Then the work begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.69,0:33:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迎接新世界\N{\rEng}The new world begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.64,0:34:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\rEng}All this...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.11,0:34:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都过去了\N{\rEng}All this is just what was.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.95,0:34:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来一定不只如此\N{\rEng}There's gotta be somethin' after.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的枪是怎么回事\N{\rEng}What happened to their guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.02,0:34:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你干的吗\N{\rEng}Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.60,0:34:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.93,0:34:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我瞒着同事们\N{\rEng}I introduced a sabotaging aspect
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.72,0:34:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在制造过程中加入了破坏的一环\N{\rEng}to the manufacturing process unbeknownst to my colleagues,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.59,0:34:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灵感来源于加百利故意的笨拙\N{\rEng}inspired by Gabriel's purposeful ineptitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.61,0:34:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我吐在你身上前  你告诉我的一些事\N{\rEng}And a few things you imparted to me before I vomited on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.05,0:34:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  我用一点小手段制造出了大故障\N{\rEng}Ergo, I created a modicum of phooey for a full kablooey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.41,0:35:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了你吐在我身上\N{\rEng}That's for the puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.26,0:35:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很公平\N{\rEng}Fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.66,0:35:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给亨利的\N{\rEng}It's for Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.32,0:35:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能否告诉他  我不会有事的\N{\rEng}Will you tell him I'm gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.57,0:35:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\rEng}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.41,0:35:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会努力的\N{\rEng}I'm gonna try.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.32,0:35:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我必须没事\N{\rEng}I know I need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.04,0:35:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿我的仁慈\N{\rEng}My mercy...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.00,0:35:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜过我的怒火\N{\rEng}prevails...over my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.76,0:37:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰一下  玛姬\N{\rEng}Excuse me. Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.53,0:37:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要回救世堂\N{\rEng}The...guys are going back to the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.44,0:37:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算把那里改造成别的样子\N{\rEng}Gonna...try and make something else out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.81,0:37:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上\N{\rEng}The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.54,0:37:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都不属于那\N{\rEng}I was never meant to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.32,0:37:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看了那本书\N{\rEng}I-I've been reading that book, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.35,0:37:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《通向未来的钥匙》\N{\rEng} "A Key to a Future."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.50,0:37:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以造东西\N{\rEng}You know, I-I can build things,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.24,0:37:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以把书中某部分变成真的\N{\rEng}I can make some of that stuff real,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.63,0:37:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为这个地方  为这些人\N{\rEng}for -- for this place, for these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.16,0:37:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想这样过我的人生\N{\rEng}It -- It's what I want to do with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.00,0:37:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的  你给了我那样的生活  所以\N{\rEng}And, no joke, you, uh -- you gave me that life, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.01,0:38:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴你能来\N{\rEng}Glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.75,0:38:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴来这里  我想是的\N{\rEng}Glad to be here. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.72,0:38:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道\N{\rEng}Well, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.62,0:38:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你们的人吗\N{\rEng}That you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.50,0:38:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  又拉了些玻璃\N{\rEng}Yeah, more glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.55,0:38:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又叫了些人帮忙一块安回去\N{\rEng}And more people to help put it back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.81,0:39:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去\N{\rEng}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.53,0:39:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道自己为什么来这\N{\rEng}I know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.89,0:39:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道自己对丹妮斯做了什么\N{\rEng}I know what I did to Denise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.90,0:39:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你\N{\rEng}To you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.23,0:39:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对其他人做了什么\N{\rEng}To other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.39,0:40:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因并不重要\N{\rEng}And it doesn't matter why.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.09,0:40:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我必须面对\N{\rEng}I knew I'd have to face it...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.16,0:40:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,付出代价  我应该这样\N{\rEng}to pay, and I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.82,0:40:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\rEng}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.67,0:40:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得看到尼根被打败  这就够了\N{\rEng}I got to see Negan taken down, and that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.34,0:40:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我呢\N{\rEng}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.82,0:40:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是个混球\N{\rEng}I'm a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.70,0:40:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回不去了\N{\rEng}There's no going back to how things were.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.80,0:40:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.05,0:41:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很对不起\N{\rEng}Look, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.88,0:41:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.97,0:41:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.84,0:41:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\rEng}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.07,0:41:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走吧  别停下\N{\rEng}You go, and you keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.44,0:41:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再回来\N{\rEng}Don't you ever come back here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果再让我在附近看到你的脸\N{\rEng}If I ever see ‭your face around here again,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.62,0:41:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就杀了你\N{\rEng}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.30,0:41:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去外面  弥补自己的过错\N{\rEng}You go out there, and you make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.45,0:41:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到她\N{\rEng}Find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.00,0:41:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是瑞克的朋友\N{\rEng}I'm a friend of Rick's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.45,0:41:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从亚历山大来的\N{\rEng}From Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.18,0:42:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说你可以去社区\N{\rEng}He says you can come back to the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.05,0:42:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想的话\N{\rEng}If you wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.80,0:42:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.42,0:42:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克想建造些东西\N{\rEng}Rick is trying to build something.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.01,0:42:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要尽可能多的人手\N{\rEng}He needs ‭all the hands he can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.46,0:42:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想展示给大家一切是可以改变的\N{\rEng}He wants to show people that things can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.20,0:42:43.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想自己一个人过的\N{\rEng}You don't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.33,0:42:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人\N{\rEng}People.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.66,0:42:50.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人是最重要的\N{\rEng}Everything is about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.15,0:42:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人是生命中最重要的东西\N{\rEng}Everything in this life that's worth a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.21,0:43:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\rEng}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.74,0:43:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根·琼斯\N{\rEng}Morgan Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.78,0:43:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以叫我安妮\N{\rEng}You can call me Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.61,0:43:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去收拾东西\N{\rEng}Let me get my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.49,0:43:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们就可以走了  -你走吧\N{\rEng}- We can go. - ‭Or you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.82,0:43:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会留下\N{\rEng}I'm gonna stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.92,0:43:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想自己待着\N{\rEng}I want to be alone. I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.77,0:43:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要独处\N{\rEng}I need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.22,0:43:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才不是说...\N{\rEng}I thought you said --
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.20,0:43:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是  但我不能\N{\rEng}They are, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.46,0:43:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\rEng}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.46,0:44:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}蜜月
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.57,0:45:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说你是对的\N{\rEng}I just wanted to say you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.47,0:45:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救下卫星站的救世军\N{\rEng}About saving the Saviors from the satellite outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.03,0:45:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们待在这\N{\rEng}Having them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.49,0:45:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不后悔自己的所作所为\N{\rEng}I don't regret what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.63,0:45:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你是对的\N{\rEng}But you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.71,0:45:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克决定不杀掉全部救世军也是对的\N{\rEng}And Rick was right about not killing all the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.77,0:45:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是对的\N{\rEng}He was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.13,0:45:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时是\N{\rEng}He was.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.64,0:45:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但尼根的事不是\N{\rEng}Not about Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.14,0:45:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做  玛姬\N{\rEng}So what does that mean, Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.95,0:45:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有很多事要做\N{\rEng}We have a lot to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.47,0:45:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把这地方建起来\N{\rEng}We have to build this place up,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.01,0:45:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让它比以前更好\N{\rEng}make it work better than before,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.37,0:45:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让这里繁荣兴旺\N{\rEng}make it thrive ‭for the people who live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.92,0:45:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要有力量\N{\rEng}We need our strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.76,0:45:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要有更强的防御力\N{\rEng}the ability ‭to defend ourselves better.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.78,0:45:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须有\N{\rEng}We have to have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.49,0:46:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有的\N{\rEng}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.05,0:46:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是瑞克和米琼恩\N{\rEng}But Rick and Michonne...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.37,0:46:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克做了错事\N{\rEng}Rick was wrong to do what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.31,0:46:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩也是\N{\rEng}Michonne, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.48,0:46:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们要潜心发展  等待时机\N{\rEng}So we're gonna bide our time, wait for our moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.46,0:46:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们会让他明白的\N{\rEng}and then we're gonna show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.27,0:46:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.69,0:46:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\rEng}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.02,0:46:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道你醒了\N{\rEng}We know you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:43.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没说过我没醒\N{\rEng}I never said I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.76,0:46:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.04,0:46:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们要告诉你一些事\N{\rEng}Because we need ‭to tell you some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.66,0:46:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在不用睁眼\N{\rEng}And you don't ‭have to open your eyes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.49,0:46:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你很快会睁开的\N{\rEng}But you're gonna open them soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.50,0:47:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们会逼你见证一切\N{\rEng}Because we're gonna make you watch what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.36,0:47:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是因为你杀过谁\N{\rEng}And this isn't about who you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.28,0:47:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我们也杀过人\N{\rEng}No, we've -- we killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.81,0:47:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是因为你对我们做过的事\N{\rEng}No, this is about what you did to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.90,0:47:11.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对很多人做过的事\N{\rEng}what you did to so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.89,0:47:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你强迫别人侍奉你\N{\rEng}How you made people live for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.22,0:47:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你强迫别人服从你\N{\rEng}how you put people under your boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.78,0:47:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我救了人\N{\rEng}I saved people!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.68,0:47:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.71,0:47:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他得知道\N{\rEng}He needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.33,0:47:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是商量\N{\rEng}This isn't a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.02,0:47:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以拆开他的线来提醒他\N{\rEng}We can open up his stitches for a little while just to remind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.65,0:47:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔设想了更好的未来\N{\rEng}Carl pictured something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.75,0:47:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们所有人一起合作\N{\rEng}All of us working together
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.68,0:47:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创造比我们更伟大的东西\N{\rEng}for something bigger than all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.34,0:47:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也有自己的工作\N{\rEng}And you'll have a job, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.52,0:47:50.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.20,0:47:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也有自己的角色\N{\rEng}You get to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.70,0:47:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会成为一个反例\N{\rEng}You'll be an example of what this will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.46,0:47:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会杀你\N{\rEng}We're not gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.15,0:48:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会伤你\N{\rEng}We're not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.65,0:48:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会坐穿牢底\N{\rEng}You're gonna rot in a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.84,0:48:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的下半生  一天接一天\N{\rEng}For the rest of your life, day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.02,0:48:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会成为我们创造文明的证据\N{\rEng}You're gonna be evidence that we're makin' a civilization,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.55,0:48:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们过去拥有的文明\N{\rEng}something like what we had,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.89,0:48:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将会重建的文明\N{\rEng}something we're gonna get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.62,0:48:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你得看着它发生\N{\rEng}And you get to watch it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.14,0:48:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会看到你对\N{\rEng}And you get to see how wrong you were
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.96,0:48:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人性和生活的错估\N{\rEng}about what people can be, about what life can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.78,0:48:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你活着  会让人们明白一切改变了\N{\rEng}You, alive, ‭is gonna help show people that things have changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.28,0:48:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,允许你活着  换来了另一条更好的出路\N{\rEng}that keepin' you breathing earns another way, a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.55,0:48:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你要扮演的角色\N{\rEng}That's the part you'll play.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.65,0:48:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以经历了这么多\N{\rEng}So after all this...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.22,0:48:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你终于有点用了\N{\rEng}maybe you're good for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.80,0:49:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.25,0:49:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.69,0:49:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\rEng}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.53,0:49:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在知道了\N{\rEng}I know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.48,0:49:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您给了我很多\N{\rEng}You've given me so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.46,0:49:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您给过我很多\N{\rEng}...after you've given me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.47,0:50:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能看到了\N{\rEng}I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.56,0:50:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的卡尔\N{\rEng}Dear Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.05,0:50:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记起来了\N{\rEng}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.42,0:50:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘了自己是谁\N{\rEng}I forgot who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.27,0:50:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让我记起来了\N{\rEng}You made me remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.90,0:50:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得那天和你散步的感受\N{\rEng}I remember that feeling, walking with you that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.94,0:50:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我人生中第一次知道了自己是谁\N{\rEng}Like I finally knew who I was for the first time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.88,0:50:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我们在一起走\N{\rEng}Thing is, we were walking side-by-side,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.93,0:50:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实是你在带我去某处\N{\rEng}but you were bringin' me somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.08,0:50:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我来了这里\N{\rEng}Bringin' me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.16,0:50:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我们所有人来了新世界  卡尔\N{\rEng}Bringin' all of us to the new world, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.42,0:51:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你向我展示了新世界\N{\rEng}You showed me the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.66,0:51:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你使之成真\N{\rEng}You made it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.45,0:51:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\rEng}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.72,0:51:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记起了\N{\rEng}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.02,0:51:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\rEng}Dad.
